        "TileImage": "$($repository e4238db7-563f-4f71-9717-6e35e81988f3).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Today you will return to that mysterious test lab attic in Chongqing. Tonight our client is the test producer himself. Apparently there is some backlash going on there, and some people don&apos;t want to finish the tests. The client doesn&apos;t want to get his hands dirty, so he hired us. There are two targets, and their names are Xiang Wei and Fu Luoyang. Good luck 47, and as always... Have fun!",
